          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would be reduced to 0 Hit Points but not immediately killed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Fierceness in battle runs through your blood, and you refuse to fall from your injuries no matter how terrible they may be. You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, and your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded] condition increases by 1.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
